# A single weak link in an otherwise good chain: it must itself be above a critical value, here between 0.042 and 0.045, slightly more than for a uniform chain.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Chain of 9 with a weak link of 0.042 between sites 4 and 5
sites 9
path 1 9 kappa=0.06
link 4 5 kappa=0.042
kick 1 amplitude=2
run 2500
expect total 4
expect last 64.86302 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 12.96038 0.003
expect peak 1 58.058995 2e-4
expect count 2 1
expect arrival 2 30.97697 0.003
expect peak 2 56.590879 2e-4
expect count 3 1
expect arrival 3 48.21544 0.003
expect peak 3 56.701180 2e-4
expect count 4 1
expect arrival 4 64.86302 0.003
expect peak 4 57.139025 2e-4
expect count 5 0
expect count 6 0
expect count 7 0
expect count 8 0
expect count 9 0
expect each 1 4 1
expect silent 5 9
